	(text "RABBIT EAR - plug-in LED board for the SSTV badge. One design serves both ears.\nPlugs into J24 (left) or J25 (right) on the BACK of the main badge; LEDs face forward.\nHeader J26 is on the LED side. Its pin numbers are the mirror of the badge socket (as on any SAO):\nbadge pin 1 VLED = J26 pin 2, badge 2 GND = J26 pin 1, badge 5 data in = J26 pin 6, badge 6 data out = J26 pin 5.\nD2 is at the tip, D6 nearest the badge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 70 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b285bea1-f298-4aa8-bdb9-c351c486425e")
	)
